    {
      "id": "owvrrIAjh3GG6iYsBydEE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3540.309573454353,
      "y": -3339.3676437595354,
      "width": 386.875,
      "height": 72,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 249628347,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 1252341947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766896933563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "clk和I同时变换，会导致图像难以理解,\n真实的图像应该是clk来临前，I已经稳定，\n这个图像无法反映出来",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "clk和I同时变换，会导致图像难以理解,\n真实的图像应该是clk来临前，I已经稳定，\n这个图像无法反映出来",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "T3IDwCUzWwY1RUnhwu2Wk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2750.1057843952804,
      "y": -3073.608539018682,
      "width": 271.71875,
      "height": 72,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ff8787",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1277589339,
      "version": 554,
      "versionNonce": 613706075,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766896933563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I先变换,先计算组合逻辑\n使波形简单易懂,图像上确保了\nclk前,I已经稳定",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I先变换,先计算组合逻辑\n使波形简单易懂,图像上确保了\nclk前,I已经稳定",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "7hwDTtSb7LWm5EITEYyao",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4004.399294190611,
      "y": -3311.718731716474,
      "width": 298.59375,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1823790075,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 647267835,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766896933563,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "最佳实践,clk下降沿此时无意义,\n在这里改变I最方便",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "最佳实践,clk下降沿此时无意义,\n在这里改变I最方便",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
